  "description": {
    "text": "Blastoise + Kyurem-EX Combo Deck 60, a ready-built 60-card deck released on 15 March 2013 with the Megalo Cannon expansion. It is named for its combo: Blastoise, reprinted from Cold Flare, uses its Ability Deluge to attach Water Energy from the hand as often as you like, powering a new Kyurem-EX. It was the first ready-built deck with an ACE SPEC card, and came with a playmat, a coin, damage counters and markers and an expert guide.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: 拡張パック「メガロキャノン」、「最強爆流コンボデッキ60 カメックス＋キュレムEX」",
